{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなり西瓜を見かけなくなったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いよ！！！(でも秋も好きだよ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパー戦隊シリーズ、放送2000回\nおめでとうございます、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その記念回の放送を見まして\nその感動を熱く誰かに語りたいところだが！！\n！！！！！\nとんでもない分量になりそうなので！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とんでもない分量のモバイルメールを\n送り付けたいと思います！！！！！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、セブンイレブンライブ\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮から間もないライブでしたが\n変わらぬ熱気！楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋、京都でのライブも\nお楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そんなセブンイレブンさんでは、\n9/15夜～\n「乃木坂46×マイメロディ当りくじ」\nが登場です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、くじにチャレンジして\n色んな景品を手に入れて下さいね(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ガールズコレクション、\n有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでは、\n「裸足でsummer」\n「命は美しい」\n「ガールズルール」\nを披露させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのランウェイ姿もとっても\nかっこよかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブは「裸足でsummer」\n「僕だけの光」 も出ました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、「行くあてのない僕たち」\nフル初披露でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンは、まあやとペア！\n来てくださった方、有難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは、\n「らじらー！サンデー」でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまりかと、一緒にお仕事できて\n楽しかった～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は気まぐれで、単独行動も多いけど\n何でも言い合える、信頼し合える仲間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出れたらいいなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジさん、聞いてくださった皆さん\n有難うございました！(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの出演する舞台、\n「こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所」\n観てきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても笑い所満載で楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、千秋楽までファイトッ\n応援してるね(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は和食中心なんだけど、\n久々に洋食が食べたくて作ってみたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ でーん ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ささみ生地のピザ\nまるごとさつまいものグラタン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見コテコテに見えるけど、\nお肉や野菜でヘルシーに仕上げてます♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日だけ、実家に帰ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーくん(﹡ˆˆ﹡)だいすき！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい家族、ねこまるくんにも会えたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月3日生まれの男の子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこまるくんはとってもやんちゃで、\nリーくんのほうが先輩なのに臆病者なので\nいつも猫パンチくらってばかりいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまらなく可愛かった( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥ )\nもうずっと一緒に居たいよ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に会ったお母さんの天然も\n爆発してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「わぁこの冷蔵庫おっきい！お母さん入れそう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「お母さん、冷蔵庫には入れないよ(´･×･`)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「あ、お母さん、この洗濯機にも入れそう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでいちいち入ろうとすんのこの人..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り、車窓から虹が見えました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいことありそうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステの くるりさん見ました\nめちゃめちゃかっこよかったです\n東京披露はずるいです。。\n心に響く曲だなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず季節に敏感でいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}